<lb n="1"/>Unser <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">freündt</unclear>: <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nachburlich</unclear> willig dienst und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gruoß</unclear>, sambt
